TCLOSE_0002>,\nsatisfying the following axioms\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0005> is an isomorphism then <MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0007> and for each\n<MATH_0008> we have <MATH_0009>, then\n<MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0011>\nand <MATH_0012> is a morphism of <MATH_0013> then <MATH_0014>\nexists for all <MATH_0015> and\n<MATH_0016>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:18b6c2f35e735c1b976c63893daebb3bfd71b348ed0b6ca8181b7dc94577677d", "unit_id": "tag:00VH:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "00VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$I = \\{i\\}$", "MATH_0004": "$U_i \\to U$", "MATH_0005": "$V \\to U$", "MATH_0006": "$\\{V \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0007": "$U_i \\times_U V$", "MATH_0008": "$i \\in I$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0bcefdb0a7e46a442dcbb995a25de8c06b0137fa857b39f5d91fc52df1948c3b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:770f88849c02a57a11f4de031280c43dbe7335632031ef575d8f09b961507ec9", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nClarifications. In axiom (1) we require there should be a covering\n<MATH_0001> of <MATH_0002> such that <MATH_0003>\nis a singleton set and such that the morphism <MATH_0004> is equal to\nthe morphism <MATH_0005> given in (1). In the following we often denote\n<MATH_0006> a family of morphisms with fixed target whose index set\nis a singleton. In axiom (3) we require the existence of the covering\nfor some choice of the fibre products <MATH_0007> for <MATH_0008>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b28ff2ac2ec37374b2324c12a15c45022b146ee00d10ceb0b1bc69462c69f795", "unit_id": "tag:00VG:prose-0003"}
